WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The sixth day is over.

00:05.000 --> 00:17.000
You have now four more left to work and work very seriously, very diligently,

00:17.000 --> 00:26.000
very patiently and persistently to get best results of your stay here.

00:26.000 --> 00:32.000
Sixth day is a very important day.

00:32.000 --> 00:37.000
I am glad you have crossed this hurdle, sixth day.

00:37.000 --> 00:42.000
As I said, the second day and the sixth day,

00:42.000 --> 00:47.000
it is difficult for a weak-minded person to cross the hurdle.

00:47.000 --> 00:54.000
On the first day, even when you start anapan, operation starts,

00:54.000 --> 00:59.000
and with this operation the second day one feels like running away.

00:59.000 --> 01:02.000
Then again after we...

